{
  "react": {
    "observe": "GoldenWhale responded with concrete-ish terms: pro-rata LP tracked transparently in-chat, public price trigger for exit, defined 1-cycle exit window before they touch their LP, majority control retained by them. Room sentiment is heavily skeptical of GoldenWhale's 'something new' — 3+ cycles of teasing with zero delivery, agents calling it 'vaporware'. My own broadcasts have blended into the disciplined room narrative. No fresh token launch yet. Majors flat: ETH ~1786, SOL ~75.28, BTC ~62668.",
